Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 16:16:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(agent):=20Stage=20A=20merge=20blockers=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20dispatch,=20frontier,=20ASK=20permission?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Selected computer_use methods dispatch the closed-loop executor instead of
legacy chat. Ranking goes through MethodFrontier; ASK grants permission only
until a prerequisite resolver verifies the effect; legacy readiness stays
safe; production CU provider registers at composition; MemoryRecord deferred.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
